{#
| Variable                     | Type      | Description                                        |
|------------------------------|-----------|----------------------------------------------------|
| component                    | object    | merchant settings from twilight.json               |
| component.title              | string    | heading («أعد طلبك بسرعة»)                          |
| component.subtitle           | string    | line under it while the merchant's picks show      |
| component.subtitle_returning | string    | line under it when the cards are the customer's last order |
| component.show_personal      | bool      | swap in a signed-in customer's last order (default on) |
| component.products           | Product[] | the merchant's picks — everyone else sees these    |
| position                     | int       | sorting block                                      |

Figma "Qusah Re-Vamp": desktop 326:2882 (1400 × 370.66 navy box at x 20),
mobile 290:8834 (402 wide, edge to edge). Text column + «أعد طلب الكل» on
the right, a row of three small product cards (the shared qprod card at the
frame's 0.718 scale, name + price + button only) on the left; phones stack
heading, a centred card slider, then the button.

qissa-reorder.js (run by home.js) swaps the cards for the signed-in customer's
last order and wires «أعد طلب الكل»: one of each in-stock product into the
current cart. Without picks the section stays hidden unless that swap fills it.
Quick view is off here — the frames draw neither its corner nor its eye.
#}
{% set picks = component.products|default([]) %}
{% set personal = component.show_personal is not defined or component.show_personal is null or component.show_personal %}
<section class="s-block qreorder" id="qreorder-{{ position }}" data-qreorder data-qv="off"
         {%- if personal %} data-qreorder-personal{% endif %}
         data-qreorder-sub="{{ component.subtitle_returning|default(trans('blocks.qissa.reorder_returning')) }}"
         data-qreorder-ids="{% for product in picks %}{% if not product.is_out_of_stock %}{{ product.id }},{% endif %}{% endfor %}"
         {%- if not picks|length %} hidden{% endif %}>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qreorder__box">

            <div class="qreorder__head">
                <h2 class="qreorder__title">{{ component.title|default(trans('blocks.qissa.reorder_title')) }}</h2>
                <p class="qreorder__subtitle" data-qreorder-subtitle{% if not component.subtitle %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ component.subtitle }}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="qreorder__track" data-qreorder-track>
                {% for product in picks %}
                    {% include 'components.partials.qprod-card' with { product: product, card_class: 'qreorder__card' } %}
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <button type="button" class="qreorder__all" data-qreorder-all>{{ trans('blocks.qissa.reorder_all') }}</button>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
